### Ask the assistant about balances
POST http://localhost:8080/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: CUST-0001

{"conversationId": "demo", "message": "What are my account balances?"}

### Ask about a fee, the reply lists the documents it used
POST http://localhost:8080/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: CUST-0001

{"conversationId": "demo", "message": "Is there an overdraft fee?"}

### Ask for a transfer, the assistant can only propose it
POST http://localhost:8080/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Customer-Id: CUST-0001

{"conversationId": "demo", "message": "Move 100 dollars from ACME-CHK-0001 to my savings"}

> {% client.global.set("proposalId", response.body.pendingProposals[0].proposalId); %}

### Confirm the proposal, sending the same Idempotency-Key again returns the same transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/transfers/proposals/{{proposalId}}/confirm
X-Customer-Id: CUST-0001
Idempotency-Key: demo-confirm-0001

### List pending proposals
GET http://localhost:8080/transfers/proposals
X-Customer-Id: CUST-0001

### Monthly spending summary with model categories and computed totals
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACME-CHK-0001/spending?month=2026-09
X-Customer-Id: CUST-0001
